Every chunk belongs to one file, and a file to one repository [1][2].

```mermaid
erDiagram
  REPOSITORY ||--o{ FILE : contains
  FILE ||--|{ CHUNK : "is split into"
  CHUNK }o..o| EMBEDDING : "reuses by hash"
  REPOSITORY {
    int id PK
    string name "unique, never trimmed"
    string last_sha
  }
  FILE {
    int id PK
    int repo_id FK
    string path
  }
  CHUNK {
    int id PK
    int file_id FK
    string content_hash
  }
  EMBEDDING {
    string hash PK
    blob vector
  }
```

An embedding is shared by every chunk with the same content [2].
